OL,4,B'I miss being on court' - Sinner has   
OL,5,B'minor surgery' on knee                
OL,6,GWorld number two Jannik Sinner says he 
OL,7,Ghas had "minor surgery" on his knee,   
OL,8,Gjust seven weeks before January's      
OL,9,GAustralian Open begins.                
OL,11,FThe five-time Grand Slam champion has  
OL,12,Fnot played competitively since winning 
OL,13,FWimbledon on 12 July.                  
OL,15,FIn a post on Instagram, Sinner said he 
OL,16,Fhad undergone surgery to "improve the  
OL,17,Fcondition of my iliotibial band" - a   
OL,18,Fthick band of tissue that runs along   
OL,19,Fthe outside of the knee.               
